stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT
    DRAFT --> TESTING: 提交测试
    TESTING --> REVIEW: 评测报告生成
    REVIEW --> PUBLISHED: 审核通过
    REVIEW --> DRAFT: 打回
    PUBLISHED --> CANARY: 灰度 5% 流量
    CANARY --> PRODUCTION: 指标达标
    CANARY --> PUBLISHED: 指标异常自动回退
    PRODUCTION --> PUBLISHED: Rollback（版本回切）
    PUBLISHED --> DRAFT: 下线修改
